hadiths[48]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2290","(apne daure-khilaafat mein) unhein zakat wsool karne ke liye bhejaa. (jahaan wo zakat wsool kar rahe they wahan ke) aik shakhs ne apni biwi ki baandi se ham-bistarii kar li. Hamza ne uski aik shakhs se pahley zamaanat li, yahan tak ke wo umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne us shakhs ko so kodon ki saza di thi. us aadmi ne jo jurm is par laga tha usko qabool kya tha lekin jahaalat ka uzr kya tha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko ma'zoor rakha tha aur Jarir aur Ashas ne Abdullah-bin-Masood se murtadon ke barey mein kaha ke unse tauba karaaiye aur unki zamaanat talab kijiye (ke dobara murtad na hongey) chunanche unhon-ne tauba kar li aur zamaanat khud unhiin ke qabeele walon ne de di. Hammad ne kaha jiska hazir zaamin ho agar wo mar jaey to zaamin par kuchh taawaan na hoga. lekin hakam ne kaha ke zimme ka maal dena padega."
"2291","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bani-Israeel ke aik shakhs ka zikr farmaya ke unhon-ne Bani-Israeel ke aik doosrey aadmi se aik hazaar Dinar qarz maangey . unhon-ne kaha ke pahley aisey gawah la jinki gawahi par mujhey eitibaar ho. qarz maangney wala bola ke gawah to bas Allah hi kafi hai phir unhon-ne kaha ke achchha koi zaamin laa. qarz maangney wala bola ke zaamin bhi Allah hi kafi hai. unhon-ne kaha ke tu ney sachchii baat kahi . chunanche us ne aik muqarrara muddat ke liye usko qarz de diya. ye sahib qarz lekar dariyaaii safar par rawaana huey aur phir apni zarurat poori karke kisi sawari (kishtii wghaira) ki talash ki taake us se dariya paar karke us muqarrara muddat tak qarz dene waley ke paas pahunch sakey jo isse tay paai thi. (aur iska qarz ada kar de) lekin koi sawari nahi milii. aakhir aik lakdi li aur is mein suraakh kya. phir aik hazaar Dinar aur aik (is mazmoon ka ( khat ke uski taraf se qarz dene waley ki taraf (ye Dinar bhejey ja rahe hain) aur uska munh band kar diya aur usey dariya par ley aaey, phir kaha, aey Allaah! to khub janta hai ke maine falan shakhs se aik hazaar Dinar qarz liye they. us ne mujh se zaamin maanga to maine keh diya tha ke mera zaamin Allah Taala kafi hai aur wo bhi tujh par razi hua. us ne mujh se gawah maanga to uska bhi jawab maine yahi diya ke Allah paak gawah kafi hai to wo mujh par razi ho gaya aur (tu janta hai ke) maine bahut koshish ki ke koi sawari miley jiske zariie'y mein uska qarz us tak (muddat muqarrara mein) pahuncha sakoon. lekin mujhey usmein kamiyabi nahi hui. isliye ab main usko terey hi hawale karta hun (ke to us tak pahuncha de) chunanche us ne wo lakdi jis mein raqam thi dariya mein baha di. ab wo dariya mein thi aur wo sahib ( qarzdaar) wapas ho chukey they. halaanki fikr ab bhi yahi thi ke kis tarah koi jahaz miley. jiske zariey wo apne Shahar mein ja sakein. dusri taraf wo sahib jinhoney qarz diya tha usi talash mein (bandargaah) aaey ke mumkin hai koi jahaz unka maal lekar aaya ho. lekin wahan unhein aik lakdi milii. wahi jismein maal tha. unhon-ne lakdi apne ghar mein iindhan ke liye ley li. lekin jab usey chira to usmein se Dinar nikley aur aik khat bhi niklaa. (kuchh dinon ke baad jab wo sahib apne Shahar aaey) to qarz-khaah ke ghar aaey aur (ye khayal karke ke shayad wo lakdi na mil saki ho dobaara) aik hazaar dena unki khidmat mein pesh kar diye aur kaha ke qism Allah ki! main to barabar isi koshish mein raha ke koi jahaz miley to tumharey paas tumhara maal lekar Pohnchon lekin us din se pahley jabke main yahan pahunchne ke liye sawar hua. mujhey apni koshishon mein kamiyabi nahi hui. phir unhon-ne puchha achchha ye to bataao ke koi cheez kabhi tum ne mere naam bheji thi? maqrooz ne jawab diya bata to raha hun aapko ke koi jahaz mujhey us jahaz se pahley nahi mila jis se main aaj pahuncha hun. is par qarz-khaah ne kaha ke phir Allah ne bhi aap ka wo Qarzaa ada kar diya. jisey aap ne lakdi mein bheja tha. chunanche wo sahib apna hazaar Dinar lekar khush khosh wapas lot gaey."
"2292","( Quran Majeed ki aayat ( ولكل جعلنا موالي‏ )) ke mutaalliq Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke) mawaalii (ke mana ( Wirse ke hain. aur ( والذين عقدت أيمانكم‏ ) (kaa qissa ye hai ke) muhajireen jab Madina aaey to muhajir Ansar ka tarka patey they aur Ansari ke naatedaaron ko kuchh na miltaa. us bhaaii-paney ki wjah se jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qaaim ki hui thi. phir jab aayat ( ولكل جعلنا موالي‏ ) huii to pehli aayat ( والذين عقدت أيمانكم‏ ) mansookh ho gaee. siwa imdaad, ta'awun aur khair-khuwaahii ke. albatta meeraas ka hukm (jo Ansar w muhajireen ke darmyan bhaaichaare ki wjah se tha) wo mansukh ho gaya aur wasiiyat jitni chahey ki ja sakti hai. (jaisi aur shakhson ke liye bhi ho sakti hai tehai tarke mein se wasiiyat ki ja sakti hai jo laagu ki jaayegi)"
"2293","jab Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey yahan aaey they, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka bhai chaara Sad-bin-Rabee (Raziallahu anhu) se karaya tha."
"2294","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha kya aapko ye baat malum hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya tha, Islam mein jahiliyat waley ( ghalat qism ke) ahad w paiman nahi hain. to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to khud Ansar aur Quraish ke darmyan mere ghar mein ahad w paiman karaya tha."
"2295","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan Namaz padhney ke liye kisi ka janaaza aaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, kya us maiyat par kisi ka qarz tha? logon ne kaha ke nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki namaaze-janaaza padha di. phir aik aur janaaza aaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, maiyat par kisi ka qarz tha? logon ne kaha ke haan, tha. ye sun kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ke phir apne sathi ki tum hi Namaz padh lo. abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ya Rasulullah! unka qarz main ada kar doonga. tab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki namaaze-janaaza padhai."
"2296","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya agar Bahrain se (jiziya ka ( maal aaya to main tumhen is tarah donon lap bhar-bhar kar doonga lekin Bahrain se maal Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat tak nahi aaya phir jab iske baad wahan se maal aaya to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne elaan kara diya ke jis se bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka koi wada ho ya aap par kisi ka qarz ho wo hamarey yahan aa jaey. chunanche main hazir hua aur maine arz kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se ye wo baatein farmai thin. jisey sun kar Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey aik lap bhar kar diya. maine usey shumaar kya to wo panch so ki raqam thi. phir farmaya ke iske 2 guna aur ley lo."
"2297","maine jab se hosh sanbhaalaa to apne waalidain ko isi deene-Islam ka perokar paya aur Abu-Saleh Sulaiman ne bayan kya ke mujh se Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ne bayan kya. unse Yunus ne, aur unse Zohri ne bayan kya ke mujhey Urwa-bin-Zubair ne khabar di aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke maine jab hosh sanbhaalaa to apne waalidain ko deene-Islam ka perokar paya. koi din aisa nahi guzarta tha jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahan subah w Sham donon waqt tashrif na latey hun. phir jab musalmanon ko bahut zyada takleef honey lagi to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi hijrate-Habsha ka irada kya. jab aap Barke-Ghimaad pahunchey to wahan aap ki mulaqat Qaara ke sardaar Maalik-ibne-Daghina se hui. us ne poochha, abu-Bakar! kahan ka irada hai? Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne iska jawab ye diya ke meri qaum ne mujhey nikal diya hai. aur ab to yahi irada hai ke Allah ki zameen mein sair karun aur apne rab ki ibadat karta rahoon . is par Maalik-bin-Daghina ne kaha ke aap jaisa insan (apne watan se) nahi nikal sakta aur na usey nikala ja sakta hai. ke aap to mohtajon ke liye kamatey hain, sila rehmii kartey hain. majbooron ka bojh apne sar letey hain. mehman nawazi kartey hain. aur haadison mein haq baat ki madad kartey hain. aapko main aman deta hun. aap chaliye aur apne hi Shahar main apne rab ki ibadat kijiye . chunanche ibne-Daghina apne sath Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko lekar aaya aur Makka pahunch kar kuffaare-Quraish ke tamam ashraaf ke paas gaya aur unse kaha ke Abu-Bakar jaisa nek aadmi (apne watan se) nahi nikal sakta aur na usey nikala ja sakta hai. kya tum aisey shakhs ko bhi nikal doge jo mohtajon ke liye kamaata hai aur jo sila rehmii karta hai aur jo majbooron aur kamzoron ka bojh apne sar par leta hai. aur jo mehman nawazi karta hai aur jo haadison mein haq baat ki madad karta hai. chunanche Quraish ne ibn-Daghina ki aman ko maan liya aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko aman de di. phir ibn-Daghina se kaha ke Abu-Bakar ko uski takeed kar dena ke apne rab ki ibadat apne ghar hi mein kar liya karein. wahan jis tarah chaahein Namaz padhein, aur Quran ki tilawat karein, lekin hamein un chizon ki wjah se koi takleef na pahunchaaein aur na iska izhar karein, kyonke hamein iska dar hai ke kahin hamarey bachchey aur hamari auratein fitne mein na pad jaaein. ibn-Daghina ne ye baatein jab Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko sunain to aap apne rab ki ibadat ghar ke andar hi karne lagey. na Namaz mein kisi qism ka izhar kartey aur na apne ghar ke siwa kisi dusri jagah tilawat kartey. phir Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne kuchh dinon baad aisa kya ke aap ne apne ghar ke samney Namaz ke liye aik jagah bana li. ab aap zahir ho kar wahan Namaz padhney lagey aur usi par tilaawate-qur'aan karne lagey. to phir kya tha mushrekeen ke bachchon aur unki aurton ka majma' lagney laga. sab hairat aur tajjub ki nigahon se unhein dekhtey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) badey hi roney waley they. jab Quran padhney lagtey to aansuon par qaabu na rahtaa. is sura haal se badey-badey mushrekeene-Quraish ghabraaey aur sab ne ibn-Daghina ko bula bhejaa. ibn-Daghina unke paas aaya to un sab ne kaha ke ham ne to Abu-Bakar ko isliye aman di thi ke wo apne rab ki ibadat ghar ke andar hi karengey, lekin wo to zyadti par utar aaey aur ghar ke samney Namaz padhney ki aik jagah bana li hai. Namaz bhi sab ke samney hi padhney lagey hain aur tilawat bhi sab ke samney karne lagey hain. dar hamein apni aulad aur aurton ka hai ke kahin wo fitne mein na pad jaaein. isliye ab tum unke paas jao. agar wo is par taiyaar ho jayen ke apne rab ki ibadat sirf apne ghar ke andar hi karein, phir to koi baat nahi, lekin agar unhein us se inkar ho to tum unse kaho ke wo tumhari aman tumhen wapas kar dein. kyonke hamein ye pasand nahi ke tumhari aman ko ham tod dein. lekin is tarah unhein izhar aur elaan bhi karne nahi dengey. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke iske ba'd ibn-Daghina abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke aapko malum hai wo shart jis par mera aap se ahad hua tha. ab ya to aap us shart ki hudood mein rahen ya meri aman mujhey wapas kar dein. kyonke ye mein pasand nahi karta ke Arab ke kanon tak ye baat pahunchey ke maine aik shakhs ko aman di thi lekin wo aman tod di gaee Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke main tumhari aman tumhen wapas karta hun main to bas apne Allah ki aman se khush hun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un dinon Makka hi mein maujood they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey tumhari hijrat ka maqam dikhlaaya gaya hai. maine aik khaarii namkeen zameen dekhi hai. jahan khajoor ke baghaat hain aur wo pathreeley maidaanon ke darmyan mein hai. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iska izhar farma diya to jin musalmanon ne hijrat karni chahi wo pahley hi Madina hijrat karke chaley gaey. balke kuchh wo sahaba bhi jo Habsha hijrat karke chaley gaey they wo bhi Madina aagey Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) bhi hijrat ki taiyaariyaan karne lagey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya, jaldi na karo, ummeed hai ke mujhey bhi jald hi ijazat mil jaeygi Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne puchha mere maan-baap aap par fidaa hon ! kya aapko uski ummeed hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, zaroor! chunanche Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka intizar karne lagey, taake Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath hijrat karein. unke paas 2 oont they, unhein char mahiney tak wo babool ke pattey khilaatey rahe."
"2298","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jab kisi aisi maiyat ko laya jata jis par kisi ka qarz hota to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey ke kya usne apne qarz ke ada karne ke liye bhi kuchh chhoda hai? phir agar koi aapko bata deta ke yahan itna maal hai jis se qarz ada ho sakta hai. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski Namaz padhatey warna Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) musalmanon hi se farma detey ke apne sathi ki Namaz padh lo. phir jab Allah Taala ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par fateh ke darwazey khol diye to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main musalmanon ka khud unki zaat se bhi zyada mustahiq hun. isliye ab jo bhi musalman wafat pa jaey aur wo maqrooz raha ho to uska qarz ada karna mere zimmey hai aur jo musalman maal chhod jaey wo iske waarison ka haq hai."
"2299","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey hukm diya tha ke un qurbani ke janwaron ki jhool aur unke chamdey ko main khairat kar dun jinhein qurbaan kya gaya tha."
"2300","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuchh bakriyan unke hawale ki thin taake sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) mein unko taqseem kar dein. aik bakri ka bachcha baqi reh gaya. jab iska zikr unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski to qurbani kar ley."
"2301","maine Umayya-bin-Khalaf se ye muaahida apne aur uske darmyan likhwaayaa ke wo mere baal-bachchon ya meri jaaidaad ki jo Makka mein hai, hifazat karey aur main uski jaaidaad ki jo Madina mein hai hifazat karun. jab maine apna naam likhtey waqt Rehman ka zikr kya to usne kaha ke main Rehman ko kya jaanoon. tum apna wahi naam likhwaao jo zamana jahiliyat mein tha. chunanche maine abd Amr likhwaayaa . badr ki ladai ke mauqe par main aik pahaad ki taraf gaya taake logon se aankh bacha kar uski hifazat kar sakoon, lekin Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ne dekh liya aur fauran hi Ansar ki aik majlis mein aaey. unhon-ne majlis walon se kaha ke ye dekho Umayya-bin-Khalaf ( kaafir dushmane-Islaam) idhar maujood hai. agar Umayya kaafir bach nikla to meri naakaamii hogi. chunanche unke sath Ansar ki aik jamat hamarey peechhey ho li. jab mujhey khof hua ke ab ye log hamein aa lengey to maine uske ladkey ko aagey kar diya taake uske sath (aaney wali jama'at) mashghool rahe, lekin logon ne usey qatl kar diya aur phir bhi wo hamari hi taraf badhney lagey. Umayya bahut bhari jism ka tha. aakhir jab jama'ate-ansaar ne hamein aa liya to maine us se kaha ke zameen par let jaa. jab wo zameen par let gaya to maine apna jism uske uper daal diya. taake logon ko rok sakoon, lekin logon ne mere jism ke nichey se uske jism par talwaar ki chotein lagaaein aur usey qatl karke hi chhodaa. aik sahabi ne apni talwaar se mere paon ko bhi zakhmi kar diya tha. Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) iska nishan apne qadam ke uper hamein dikhaya kartey they."
"2302","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko khaibar ka tehseel daar banaya. wo umda qism ki khajoor laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke kya khaibar ki tamam khajoorein usi qism ki hain. unhon-ne kaha ke ham is tarah ki aik saa khajoor (is se ghatiyaa qism ki) 2 saa khajoor ke badal main aur 2 saa , teen saa ke badley mein khareedtey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hidayat farmai ke aisa na kar, albatta ghatiyaa khajooron ko paisoon ke badley bech kar unse achi qism ki khajoor khareed saktey ho. aur tauley janey ki chizon mein bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi hukm farmaya,"
"2303","rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko khaibar ka tehseel daar banaya. wo umda qism ki khajoor laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke kya khaibar ki tamam khajoorein usi qism ki hain. unhon-ne kaha ke ham is tarah ki aik saa khajoor (is se ghatiyaa qism ki) 2 saa khajoor ke badal main aur 2 saa , teen saa ke badley mein khareedtey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hidayat farmai ke aisa na kar, albatta ghatiyaa khajooron ko paisoon ke badley bech kar unse achi qism ki khajoor khareed saktey ho. aur tauley janey ki chizon mein bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi hukm farmaayaa,"
"2304","unke paas bakriyon ka aik rewad tha. jo Sala pahaadii par charney jata tha ( unhon-ne bayan kya ke) hamari aik baandi ne hamarey hi rewad ki aik bakri ko (jab ke wo char rahi thi) dekha ke marney ke qareeb hai. us ne aik patthar tod kar us se us bakri ko zabah kar diya. unhon-ne apne ghar walon se kaha ke jab tak main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske barey mein main poochh na loon iska gosht na khaanaa. ya ( yun kaha ke) jab tak mein kisi ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein iske barey mein poochhney ke liye na bhejoon, chunanche unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske barey mein poochha, ya kisi ko (poochhney ke liye) bhejaa, aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iska gosht khaney ke liye hukm farmaya, Ubaidullah ne kaha ke mujhey ye baat ajeeb malum hui ke baandi ( aurat ( honey ke bawajud us ne zabah kar diya. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Abda ne Ubaidullah ke waaste se ki hai."
"2305","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par aik shakhs ka aik khas Umr ka oont qarz tha. wo shakhs taqaza karne aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (apne sahaba se) farmaya ke ada kar do. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne us Umr ka oont talash kya lekin nahi mila. albatta us se zyada Umr ka ( mil saka (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke yahi unhein de do. is par us shakhs ne kaha ke aap ne mujhey pooraa-pooraa haq de diya. Allah Taala aapko bhi pura badla de. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein sabse behtar wo log hain jo qarz wghaira ko poori tarah ada kar detey hain."
"2306","aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (apne qarz ka ( taqaza karne aaya, aur sakht guftgu karne laga. sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ghussa ho kar uski taraf badhey lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey chhod do. kyonke jiska kisi par haq ho to wo ( baat ( kehney ka bhi haq rakhta hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke iske qarz waley janwar ki Umr ka aik janwar usey de do. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ya Rasulullah ! us se zyada Umr ka janwar to maujood hai. (lekin us Umr ka nahi (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey wahi de do. kyonke sabse achchha aadmi wo hai jo dusron ka haq poori tarah ada kar de."
"2307","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein (jange-Hunain ke baad) jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua to unhon-ne darkhaast ki ke unke maal w daulat aur unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sabse zyada sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pyari hai. tumhen apne 2 mataalbon mein se sirf kisi aik ko ikhtiyar karna hoga, ya qaidi wapas ley lo, ya maal ley lo, main is par ghaur karne ki wafad ko mohlat bhi deta hun. chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se waapsii ke baad unka (Ja'araana mein) taqriban das raat tak intizar kya. phir jab qabila Hawazin ke wakeelon par ye baat waazeh ho gaee ke aap unke mutaalbe ka sirf aik hi hissey taslim kar saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham sirf apne un logon ko wapas lena chahtey hain jo aap ki qaid mein hain. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab farmaya, pahley Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq hamd w sana bayan ki, phir farmaya, ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai tauba karke musalman ho kar tumharey paas aaey hain. isliye maine munasib jana ke unke qaidiyon ko wapas kar dun. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se aisa karna chahey to usey kar guzrey aur jo shakhs ye chahta ho ke iska hissey baqi rahe aur ham iske us hisse ko) qeemat ki shakl mein) us waqt wapas kar dein jab Allah Taala (aaj ke baad) sabse pahlaa maale-ghanimat kahin se dila de to usey bhi kar guzarna chahiye ye sun kar sab log bol padey ke ham b-khushi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khaatir unke qaidiyon ko chhodney ke liye taiyaar hain. lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah ham uski tameez nahi kar saktey ke tum mein se kis ne ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. isliye tum sab (apne apney deron mein) wapas jao aur wahan se tumharey wakeel tumhara faisla hamarey paas laaein. chunanche sab log wapas chaley gaey aur unke sardaaron ne (jo unke numaaindey they) is sura haal par baat ki phir wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aapko bataya ke sab ne b-khushi dil se ijazat de di hai."
"2308","nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein (jange-Hunain ke baad) jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua to unhon-ne darkhaast ki ke unke maal w daulat aur unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sabse zyada sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pyari hai. tumhen apne 2 mataalbon mein se sirf kisi aik ko ikhtiyar karna hoga, ya qaidi wapas ley lo, ya maal ley lo, main is par ghaur karne ki wafad ko mohlat bhi deta hun. chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se waapsii ke baad unka (Ja'araana mein) taqriban das raat tak intizar kya. phir jab qabila Hawazin ke wakeelon par ye baat waazeh ho gaee ke aap unke mutaalbe ka sirf aik hi hissey taslim kar saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham sirf apne un logon ko wapas lena chahtey hain jo aap ki qaid mein hain. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab farmaya, pahley Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq hamd w sana bayan ki, phir farmaya, ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai tauba karke musalman ho kar tumharey paas aaey hain. isliye maine munasib jana ke unke qaidiyon ko wapas kar dun. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se aisa karna chahey to usey kar guzrey aur jo shakhs ye chahta ho ke iska hissey baqi rahe aur ham iske us hisse ko) qeemat ki shakl mein) us waqt wapas kar dein jab Allah Taala (aaj ke baad) sabse pahlaa maale-ghanimat kahin se dila de to usey bhi kar guzarna chahiye ye sun kar sab log bol padey ke ham b-khushi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khaatir unke qaidiyon ko chhodney ke liye taiyaar hain. lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah ham uski tameez nahi kar saktey ke tum mein se kis ne ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. isliye tum sab (apne apney deron mein) wapas jao aur wahan se tumharey wakeel tumhara faisla hamarey paas laaein. chunanche sab log wapas chaley gaey aur unke sardaaron ne (jo unke numaaindey they) is sura haal par baat ki phir wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aapko bataya ke sab ne b-khushi dil se ijazat de di hai."
"2309","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik safar mein tha aur main aik sust oont par Sawar tha aur wo sabse aakhir mein rehta tha. ittifaq se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka guzar meri taraf se hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye kon sahib hain? maine arz kya Jabir-bin-Abdullah , Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya baat hui (ke itney peechhey reh gaey ho) main bola ke aik bahut hi zyada sust raftaar oont par Sawar hun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tumharey paas koi chhadi bhi hai? maine kaha ke ji haan hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo mujhey de-dey. maine aap ki khidmat mein wo pesh kar di. aap ne us chhadi se oont ko jo maara aur daantaa to uske baad wo sabse aagey rehney laga. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ke ye oont mujhey farokht kar de. maine arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! ye to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hi hai, lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey mujhey bech de. ye bhi farmaya ke char Dinar mein usey main khareedtaa hon waisey tum Madina tak usi par Sawar ho kar chal saktey ho. phir jab Madina ke qareeb ham pahunchey to main (doosri taraf) janey laga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kahan ja rahe ho? maine arz kya ke maine aik bewa aurat se shadi kar li hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kisi kunwaarii se kyon na ki ke tum bhi uske sath kheltey aur wo bhi tumharey sath kheltii . maine arz kya ke walid shahadat pa chukey hain. aur ghar mein kai bahnein hain. isliye maine sochaa ke kisi aisi khatun se shadi karun jo bewa aur tajriba kaar ho. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir to theek hai, phir Madina pahunchne ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Bilaal! unki qeemat ada kar do aur kuchh badha kar de do. chunanche unhon-ne char Dinar bhi diye aur faaltu aik qirat bhi diya. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) kaha kartey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye inaam main apne se kabhi juda nahi karta, chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka wo qirat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) hamesha apni thaili mein mehfooz rakha kartey they."
"2310","aik aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! maine khud ko aapko bakhsh diya. is par aik sahabi ne kaha ke aap mera unse nikah kar dijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumhara nikah unse us mehar ke sath kya jo tumhen Quran yad hai."
"2311","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey Ramazan ki zakat ki hifazat par muqarrar farmaya, (raat mein) aik shakhs achcha mere paas aaya aur ghalle mein se lap bhar-bhar kar uthaney laga maine usey pakad liya aur kaha ke qism Allah ki! main tujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein ley chaloonga. is par usne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! main bahut mohtaaj hun. mere baal bachchey hain aur main sakht zarurat mand hun. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha (iske izhaare-ma'zirat par) maine usey chhod diya. subah hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se poochha, aey abu-Huraira! pichhli raat tumharey qaidi ne kaha kya tha? maine kaha ya Rasulullah! us ne sakht zarurat aur baal bachchon ka ronaa royaa, isliye mujhey is par raham aa gaya aur maine usey chhod diya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo tum se jhoot bol kar gaya hai. abhi wo phir aayega. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us farmaney ki wjah se mujh ko yaqin tha ke wo phir zaroor aayega. isliye main uski taak mein laga raha aur jab wo dusri raat aa ke phir ghalla uthaney laga to maine usey phir pakda aur kaha ke tujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir karunga, lekin ab bhi uski wahi iltijaa thi ke mujhey chhod de, main mohtaaj hun. baal-bachchon ka bojh mere sar par hai. ab main kabhi na aaoonga. mujhey raham aa gaya aur maine usey phir chhod diya. subah hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aey abu-Huraira! tumharey qaidi ne kya kahaa? maine kaha ya Rasulullah! us ne phir usi sakht zarurat aur baal bachchon ka ronaa royaa. jis par mujhey raham aa gaya. isliye maine usey chhod diya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us martaba bhi yahi farmaya ke wo tum se jhoot bol kar gaya hai aur wo phir aayega. teesri martaba main phir iske intizar mein tha ke usne phir teesri raat aa kar ghalla uthana shuru kya, to maine usey pakad liya, aur kaha ke tujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pahunchaanaa ab zaroori ho gaya hai. ye teesra mauqa hai. har martaba tum yaqin dilaatey rahe ke phir nahi aaogey. lekin tum baaz nahi aaey. usne kaha ke us martaba mujhey chhod de to main tumhen aisey chand kalimaat sikhaa doonga jis se Allah Taala tumhen fayda pahunchaaeyga. maine puchha wo kalimaat kya hain? us ne kaha, jab tum apne bistar par letney lago to aayatal-kursii (الله لا إله إلا هو الحي القيوم) poorii padh liya karo. aik nigraan farishta Allah Taala ki taraf se barabar tumhari hifazat karta rahega aur subah tak shaitan tumharey paas bhi nahi aa sakega. us martaba bhi phir maine usey chhod diya. subah hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, pichhli raat tumharey qaidi ne tum se kya mamla kya? maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! usne mujhey chand kalimaat sikhaaey aur yaqin dilaya ke Allah Taala mujhey us se fayda pahunchaaeyga. isliye maine usey chhod diya. aap ne malum kya ke wo kalimaat kya hain? maine arz kya ke usne bataya tha ke jab bistar par leto to aayatal-kursii padh lo, shuru' (الله لا إله إلا هو الحي القيوم)  se aakhir tak. us ne mujh se ye bhi kaha ke Allah Taala ki taraf se tum par (iske padhney se) aik nigraan farishta muqarrar rahega aur subah tak shaitan tumharey qareeb bhi nahi aa sakega. sahaba khair ko sabse aagey badh kar leney waley they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (unki ye baat sun kar) farmaya ke agarche wo jhoota tha. lekin tum se ye baat sach keh gaya hai. aey abu-Huraira! tum ko ye bhi malum hai ke teen raaton se tumhara mamla kis se tha? unhon-ne kaha nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo shaitan tha."
"2312","Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein barnii khajoor (khajoor ki aik umda qism) lekar aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye kahan se laey ho? unhon-ne kaha hamarey paas kharaab khajoor thi, iske 2 saa iske aik saa ke badley mein de kar ham usey laey hain. taake ham ye aapko khilaaein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tauba tauba ye to sood hai bilkul sood. aisa na kya kar albatta (achchhii khajoor) kharidney ka irada ho to (kharaab) khajoor bech kar (iski qeemat se) umda khareedaa kar."
"2313","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne sadqe ke baab mein jo kitab likhwaaii thi usmein yun hai ke sadqey ka mutwallii usmein se kha sakta hai aur dost ko khilaa sakta hai lekin rupya na jama karey aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) apne walid umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke sadqey ke mutwallii they. wo Makka walon ko usmein se tohfa bhejtey they jahan aap qiyam farmaya kartey they."
"2385","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik jang mein Sharik tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, apne oont ke barey mein tumhari kya raey hai. kya tum usey bechogey? maine kaha haan, chunanche oont maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bech diya aur jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina pahunchey. to subah oont ko lekar main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey uski qeemat ada kar di."
"2386","ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Yahudi se ghalla aik khas muddat (ke qarz par) khareedaa , aur apni lohey ki zirah uske paas rahan rakh di."
"2387","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo koi logon ka maal qarz ke taur par ada karne ki niyat se leta hai to Allah Taala bhi uski taraf se ada karega aur jo koi na dene ke liye ley, to Allah Taala bhi usko tabah kar dega."
"2388","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab dekha, aap ki murad Uhud pahaad (ko dekhney) se thi. to farmaya ke main ye bhi pasand nahi karunga ke Uhud pahaad soney ka ho jaey to usmein se mere paas aik Dinar ke barabar bhi teen din se zyada baqi rahe. siwa us Dinar ke jo main kisi ka qarz ada karne ke liye rakh loon. phir farmaya, (duniyaa mein) dekho jo zyada (maal) waley hain wahi mohtaaj hain. siwa unke jo apne maal w daulat ko yun aur yun kharch karein. abu-Shihaab rawi ne apne samney aur daain taraf aur baain taraf ishara kya, lekin aisey logon ki tadaad kam hoti hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya yahin thahrey raho aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) thodi door aagey ki taraf badhey. maine kuchh awaz suni (jaisey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi se baatein kar rahe hon) maine chaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho jaun. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye farman yad aaya ke'' yahin us waqt tak thahrey rehna jab tak mein na aa jaaun'' iske baad jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to maine puchha ya Rasulullah! abhi maine kuchh suna tha. ya (raawii ne ye kaha ke) maine koi awaz suni thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tum ne bhi sunaa! maine arz kya ke haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere paas Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) aaey they aur keh gaey hain ke tumhari ummat ka jo shakhs bhi us haalat mein marey ke wo Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik na thahraataa ho, to wo jannat mein dakhil hoga. maine puchha ke agarche wo is tarah (ke gunaah) karta raha ho. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha ke haan."
"2389","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, agar mere paas Uhud pahaad ke barabar bhi sona ho tab bhi mujhey ye pasand nahi ke teen din guzar jayen aur us ( soney (ka koi hissey mere paas reh jaey. siwa uske jo main kisi qarz ke dene ke liye rakh chhodun. uski riwayat Saleh aur Aqeel ne Zohri se ki hai."
"2390","aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apne qarz ka taqaza kya aur sakht-sust kaha, sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko saza deeni chahi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey kehney do. saahibe-haq ke liye kehney ka haq hota hai aur usey aik oont khareed kar de do. logon ne arz kya ke iske oont se (jo us ne aapko qarz diya tha) achi umr hi ka oont mil raha hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wahi khareed ke usey de do. kyonke tum mein achchha wahi hai jo qarz ada karne mein sabse achchha ho. (hadees aur baab ki mutaabiqat zahir hai)"
"2391","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik shakhs ka intiqal hua (qabr mein) us se sawal hua, tumharey paas koi neki hai? usne kaha ke main logon se khareed-farokht karta tha. (aur jab kisi par mera qarz hotaa) to main maaldaaron ko mohlat diya karta tha aur tang-daston ke qarz ko maaf kar diya karta tha is par uski bakhshish ho gaee. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine yahi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai."
"2392","aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apna qarz ka oont maangney aaya. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba se farmaya ke usey iska oont de do. sahaba ne arz kya ke qarz denewaale ke oont se achi umr ka hi oont mil raha hai. is par us shakhs (qarz denewaale) ne kaha mujhey tum ne mera pura haq diya. tumhen Allah tumhara haq pura pooraa de! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey wahi oont de do kyonke behtreen shakhs wo hai jo sabse zyada behtar tariqa par apna qarz ada karta ho."
"2393","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par aik shakhs ka aik khas umr ka oont qarz tha. wo shakhs Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se taqaza karne aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey oont de do. sahaba ne talash kya lekin aisa hi oont mil saka jo qarz-khaah ke oont se achi umr ka tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wahi de do. is par us shakhs ne kaha ke aap ne mujhey mera haq poori tarah diya Allah aapko bhi iska badla pura pooraa de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein behtar aadmi wo hai jo qarz ada karne mein bhi sabse behtar ho."
"2394","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjide-Nabawi mein tashrif rakhtey they. Misar ne bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke unhon-ne chasht ke waqt ka zikr kya. (ke us waqt khidmate-nabawii mein hazir hua) phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke 2 rakaat Namaz padh lo. mera Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par qarz tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ada kya, balke zyada bhi de diya."
"2395","unke walid ( Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu)) Uhud ke din Shahid kar diye gaey they. un par qarz chala aa raha tha. qarz khaahon ne apne haq ke mutaalbey mein sakhti ikhtiyar ki to main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farma liya ke wo mere baagh ki khajoor ley lein aur mere walid ko maaf kar dein. lekin qarz khaahon ne us se inkar kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein mere baagh ka mewa nahi diya aur farmaya ke ham subah ko tumharey baagh mein aaeingey. chunanche jab subah hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey baagh mein tashrif laey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) darakhton mein phirtey rahe aur uske mewey mein barkat ki dua farmatey rahe. phir maine khajoor todii aur unka tamam qarz ada karne ke baad bhi khajoor baqi bach gaee."
"2396","jab unke walid Shahid huey to aik Yahudi ka tees wasq qarz apne uper chhod gaey. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se mohlat maangii, lekin wo nahi maanaa. phir Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey taake Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us Yahudi (Abu-Shaham) se (mohlat dene ki) sifarish karein. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur Yahudi se ye farmaya ke Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ke baagh ke phal (jo bhi hon) us qarz ke badley mein ley ley. jo unke walid ke uper uska hai, us ne us se bhi inkar kya. ab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baagh mein dakhil huey aur is mein chaltey rahe phir Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke baagh ka phal tod ke iska qarz ada karo. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas tashrif laey to unhon-ne baagh ki khajoorein todiin aur Yahudi ka tees wasq ada kar diya. satrah wasq usmein se bach bhi raha. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey taake aapko bhi ye itlaa dein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt Asr ki Namaz padh rahe they. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farigh huey to unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko itlaa di. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski khabar ibne-khattaab ko bhi kar do. chunanche Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaey. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya, main to usi waqt samajh gaya tha jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baagh mein chal rahe they ke usmein zaroor barkat ho gaee."
"2397","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz mein dua kartey to ye bhi kehtey ''aey Allaah! main gunah aur qarz se teri panah mangta hoon.'' kisi ne arz kya ya Rasulullah! aap qarz se itni panah maangtey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab diya ke jab aadmi maqrooz hota hai to jhoot boltaa hai aur wada karke uski khilaf warzi karta hai."
"2398","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs (apne intiqal ke waqt) maal chhodey to wo uske waarison ka hai aur jo qarz chhodey to wo hamarey zimme hai."
"2399","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, har momin ka main duniya w aakhirat mein sabse zyada qareeb hun. agar tum chaho to ye aayat padh lo ( النبي أولى بالمؤمنين من أنفسهم‏ ( '' Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mominon se unki jaan se bhi zyada qareeb hain.'' isliye jo momin bhi intiqal kar jaey aur maal chhod jaey to chahiye ke waaris uske Malik hun. wo jo bhi hon aur jo shakhs qarz chhod jaey ya aulad chhod jaey to wo mere paas aa jayen ke unka wali main hun."
"2400","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, maaldaar ki taraf se (qarz ki adaaeygi mein) taal matol karna zulm hai."
"2401","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik shakhs qarz maangney aur sakht taqaza karne laga. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne uski goshmaalii karni chahi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey chhod do, haqdaar aisi baatein keh sakta hai."
"2402","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ya ye bayan kya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna, jo shakhs hoo-bahoo apna maal kisi shakhs ke paas pa ley jabke wo shakhs deewaaliya qarar diya ja chuka ho to saahibe-maal hi uska dusron ke muqaabley mein zyada mustahiq hai."
"2403","aik shakhs ne apna aik ghulam apni maut ke sath aazad karne ke liye kaha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us ghulam ko mujh se kon khareedtaa hai? Naeem-bin-Abdullaah ne usey khareed liya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski qeemat (aath (8) so dirham) wsool karke iske Malik ko de di."
"2404","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi Israaeelii shakhs ka tazkira farmaya jisne doosrey Israaeelii shakhs se qarz maanga tha aur us ne aik muqarrara muddat ke liye usey qarz de diya. (jiska zikr pahley guzar chuka hai)."
"2406","aur aik martaba main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik jihad mein aik oont par Sawar ho kar gaya. oont thak gaya. isliye main logon se peechhey reh gaya. itney main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey peechhey se maara aur farmaya ke ye oont mujhey bech do. Madina tak is par sawari ki tumhen ijazat hai. phir jab ham Madina se qareeb huey to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat chaahii, arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! maine abhi nai shadi ki hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, kunwari se ki hai ya bewa se ? maine kaha ke bewa se. mere walid Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) Shahid huey to apne peechhey kai chhoti bachchiyaan chhod gaey hain. isliye maine bewa se ki taake unhein taleem de aur adab sikhaatii rahe. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, achchha ab apne ghar jao. chunanche main ghar gaya. maine jab apne maamun se oont bechney ka zikr kya to unhon-ne mujhey malaamat ki. isliye maine unse oont ke thak janey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke waqia ka bhi zikr kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke oont ko maarney ka bhii. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina pahunchey to main bhi subah ke waqt oont lekar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey oont ki qeemat bhi de di, aur wo oont bhi mujhey wapas bakhsh diya aur qaum ke sath mera (maal ghaneemat ka ( hissey bhi mujh ko bakhsh diya."
"2407","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik shakhs ne arz kya ke khareed-farokht mein mujhey dhokaa de diya jata hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab khareed w farokht kya karo, to keh diya karke koi dhokaa na ho. chunanche phir wo shakhs isi tarah kaha karta tha."
"2408","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Allah Taala ne tum par maan (aur baap) ki nafarmani ladkiyon ko zinda dafn karnaa, (waajib huquq ki) adaaeygi na karna aur (doosron ka maal naajaaiz tareeqe par) daba lena haram qarar diya hai. aur fuzool bakwaas karne aur kasarat se sawal karne aur maal zaaye karne ko makruh qarar diya hai."
"2409","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna, tum mein se har fard aik tarah ka Hakim hai aur uski raiyat (zimmedaarii) ke barey mein us se sawal hoga. to badshah Hakim hi hai aur uski raiyat ke barey mein us se sawal hoga. har insan apne ghar ka Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. aurat apne shauhar ke ghar ki Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. khaadim apne aaqa ke maal ka Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat (zimmedaarii) ke barey mein sawal hoga. unhon-ne bayan kya ke ye sab maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha aur main samajhta hun ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya tha ke mard apne walid ke maal ka Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. to har shakhs Hakim hai aur har shakhs se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga."